WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.320
A few months ago, I participated in 
a debate contest in school,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.552
and we discussed whether 
Artificial Intelligence use

00:00:13.552 --> 00:00:16.001
is beneficial for human future.

00:00:16.001 --> 00:00:19.132
Artificial intelligence is a type 
of computer technology

00:00:19.132 --> 00:00:22.919
which is concerned with making 
machines work in an intelligent way,

00:00:22.919 --> 00:00:26.453
similar to the way that 
the human mind works.

00:00:26.453 --> 00:00:29.451
So, I belonged to the team 
which opposes AI use.

00:00:29.451 --> 00:00:31.711
Actually, I wanted to be in the pro team

00:00:31.711 --> 00:00:34.381
Because for what reasons 
do we oppose AI use?

00:00:34.381 --> 00:00:37.181
I mean, AI exists to help us, right?

00:00:37.181 --> 00:00:40.290
But there were too many people 
who wanted to be in the pro team

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:44.643
And I had no choice but 
to be in the opposing team.

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:48.211
So our team searched information 
about side effects of AI.

00:00:48.211 --> 00:00:51.752
And actually, we stayed up 
all night doing the research

00:00:51.752 --> 00:00:58.002
because our teacher only gave us 
one day to prepare for the debates.

00:00:58.002 --> 00:01:05.191
I usually think every experience 
is worth it, but not this time.

00:01:05.191 --> 00:01:09.381
Anyway, in the first debate,
we argued that AI takes away human jobs,

00:01:09.381 --> 00:01:11.920
and finally, it would dominate human.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.302
And the other team said AI
is perfect in all way

00:01:16.302 --> 00:01:19.761
and the world will develop 
if human keeps using it.

00:01:19.761 --> 00:01:23.461
We fought really hard 
and finally were in the third place.

00:01:23.461 --> 00:01:26.090
After the debate, one 
of the facts I learned

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:31.421
is that many jobs which are done by humans
are now being done by AI.

00:01:31.421 --> 00:01:32.742
Suppose you have a choice.

00:01:32.742 --> 00:01:36.162
You can either ask your brother 
to help you with your math homework --

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:38.691
by the way, you're not sure 
how good at math he is --

00:01:38.691 --> 00:01:41.310
or you can ask a super robot.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.658
Who will you choose?

00:01:42.658 --> 00:01:43.968
Please raise your hand.

00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:45.598
Your brother?

00:01:45.598 --> 00:01:48.851
Super robot?

00:01:48.851 --> 00:01:51.122
Thank you. Now you can lower your hands,

00:01:51.122 --> 00:01:54.641
Like all of you, many people 
choose super robot for work

00:01:54.641 --> 00:01:57.450
due to its effectiveness and accuracy.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:02.954
However, there are many fields in human
jobs which require subjective decisions

00:02:02.954 --> 00:02:06.251
and the law section is a great case.

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:10.731
Since I was little, I’ve heard a lot of 
cases through my father who is a judge.

00:02:10.731 --> 00:02:15.351
And he told me that many judges 
are subjective while working

00:02:15.351 --> 00:02:17.567
whether they intend to be or not.

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:22.011
For example, Judge A says a defendant
should be in jail for two years

00:02:22.011 --> 00:02:25.170
while Judge B says one year is enough

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.511
And this is because all judges think 
differently about the same case.

00:02:28.511 --> 00:02:32.621
And in this respect, humans tend 
to be more subjective

00:02:32.621 --> 00:02:36.022
while AI is objective in doing work.

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:40.021
We can easily see computers doing
objective tasks

00:02:40.021 --> 00:02:46.449
but now AI is allowing certain fields
to automate subjective tasks as well,

00:02:46.449 --> 00:02:48.471
including the justice system.

00:02:48.471 --> 00:02:50.992
Have you ever heard of ROSS Intelligence?

00:02:50.992 --> 00:02:56.811
ROSS Intelligence is first AI lawyer, 
which collects and analyzes leading cases.

00:02:56.811 --> 00:03:00.171
Even though some people say 
that lawyers can be replaced by AI,

00:03:00.171 --> 00:03:03.732
lawyers are concerned 
about the extension of AI use

00:03:03.732 --> 00:03:07.993
in a point that it is unable 
to understand individual cases.

00:03:07.993 --> 00:03:10.781
Similarly, according to 
a research team in Oxford,

00:03:10.781 --> 00:03:15.527
judge as a job is at risk 
of disappearing by advent of AI.

00:03:15.527 --> 00:03:20.662
As Artificial Intelligence is quickly 
spreading all over the world,

00:03:20.662 --> 00:03:24.281
robot judge, which is able 
to reflect about hundreds of cases

00:03:24.281 --> 00:03:27.772
is likely to be developed 
in the near future.

00:03:27.772 --> 00:03:29.950
Let me give you an example.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:34.622
You are impoverished and living with your
daughter who is only two years old.

00:03:34.622 --> 00:03:37.442
One day, she is crying 
because she’s hungry,

00:03:37.442 --> 00:03:39.904
but you find no money in your pocket.

00:03:39.904 --> 00:03:44.872
So you determine to go to a market 
and steal some milk powder.

00:03:44.872 --> 00:03:50.252
You get caught and you're arrested
and put on trial with an AI judge

00:03:50.252 --> 00:03:57.449
who sentences you exactly the same way 
it sentences a person who stole a TV.

00:03:57.449 --> 00:04:00.410
Of course I might give you 
an extreme example,

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:06.331
but this kind of situation can actually 
happen considering the properties of AI.

00:04:06.331 --> 00:04:12.371
Unfortunately, we can’t prevent this AI 
from being introduced into our world

00:04:12.371 --> 00:04:17.142
because the extension 
of AI use is like a general trend.

00:04:17.142 --> 00:04:23.491
So we should find a way to take advantage 
of AI in more effective ways.

00:04:23.491 --> 00:04:28.862
In the future, there are several ways that
AI might be used in legal judgments.

00:04:28.862 --> 00:04:33.202
In the current system, both lawyers 
and judges are human.

00:04:33.202 --> 00:04:38.960
One possible option for the future is 
that a defendant might be able to choose

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.772
whether they want an AI judgment 
or a human judgment.

00:04:42.772 --> 00:04:48.721
First is when defendant want themselves 
to be judged by only human judgement 100%.

00:04:48.721 --> 00:04:52.349
In this case, a judge can listen 
to the argument of the accused

00:04:52.349 --> 00:04:54.710
and understand the individual cases.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:05:00.402
If the accused wants a ruling 
that allows for subjectivity,

00:05:00.402 --> 00:05:07.531
he or she may prefer 
a 100% human judge with no AI.

00:05:07.531 --> 00:05:13.412
But allowing for human subjectivity 
also leaves room for human prejudice.

00:05:13.412 --> 00:05:17.742
Throughout history, 
many cases have been affected

00:05:17.742 --> 00:05:20.421
by the prejudice of humans 
making legal decisions,

00:05:20.421 --> 00:05:26.211
like all-white juries in cases 
against African-American defendants

00:05:26.211 --> 00:05:30.230
in the Civil Rights era 
in the United States.

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:33.592
Well, this circumstance 
actually happens these days

00:05:33.592 --> 00:05:37.910
because of the subjectivity of judgment.

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:43.829
In these cases, a ruling from AI may be
fairer because it might be more objective.

00:05:43.829 --> 00:05:48.110
Through the system which delivers 
automatically

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:53.071
by considering the information
and evidence,

00:05:53.071 --> 00:05:54.892
they would be likely to be sentenced

00:05:54.892 --> 00:05:58.831
without being swayed 
by judge's prejudice.

00:05:58.831 --> 00:06:05.296
I think judge is the very job 
with coexistence of AI and human

00:06:05.296 --> 00:06:09.999
because it needs both subjectivity 
and objectivity.

00:06:09.999 --> 00:06:13.072
Not only for judge, 
but also for other jobs,

00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:20.690
we should not bring in AI unadvisedly 
and let it dominate human jobs.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:24.637
AI can benefit our world.

00:06:24.637 --> 00:06:28.786
But we should not forget it 
is like a double-edged sword

00:06:28.786 --> 00:06:33.541
and there should be detailed 
restrictions to use it effectively.

00:06:33.541 --> 00:06:34.551
Thank you.

